WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
A screen recording of the mausVoice desktop app.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.000
The recording pill shows a live waveform while the user speaks.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The transcript is cleaned up by AI in the selected writing style.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.500
The cleaned text is copied.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.530
The text is pasted into the focused application.
